{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日はEX大衆\n発売日でした！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若月とオリジナルユニット会議\nさせていただきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/16/2633336/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かなり深いところまでついて\n喋ってるんで\n読んでみてほしい！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてこのユニット\n本当に実現させたい！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お願いします、今野さん！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のEX大衆は\n乃木坂デビュー4周年記念特集号になってます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"表紙がまいまい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、EX大衆さん\n乃木坂のメンバーが表紙だと\n色味が紫になりますよね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/16/2633336/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまいのグラビア全部可愛いよ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"特に\n2ページ目の下と\n4ページ目の左上\n好き"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/16/2633336/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、裏表紙はらりん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーからのメッセージが入ってるんだけど\n中田も書かせていただきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/16/2633336/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ロングインタビューや\nイジリーさんからのメッセージ\n読みごたえあります` ･ω･ ´"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他にも\n生駒ちゃん、かりんちゃん、さゆりん、かずみん、琴子\nとメンバーたくさん載ってるので\nチェックよろしくね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/16/2633336/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/16/2633336/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飯ぺろ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は\nどんなに買いたくても買えないでしょう\nどんなに食べたくても食べれないでしょう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなスイーツを紹介します"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/16/2633336/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若月佑美の『生チョコ』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あああああ\n写メがないー！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんせ若月に\nあーん してもらったから\n写メをとる隙なんて無かった！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れっつ いまじん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ホワイト生チョコと塩ココア生チョコの2種類"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まずホワイトをあーん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"口溶けの良さね\n一口でいく贅沢感！\n甘さがわーーーっと広がる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"続いて塩ココアをあーん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こっちは\nパウダーに塩が少し使われてるんだけど\nそれが甘さとコクを引き立ててくれてる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美味しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/16/2633336/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若月の女の子な部分を拝見しました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/16/2633336/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}